Troubleshooting
Merge Conflict Issues
Problem: Confused about conflict markers

# View conflict markers explanation
# <<<<<<< HEAD (your current branch changes)
# ======= (separator)
# >>>>>>> branch-name (incoming changes)

# To abort a merge
git merge --abort
Problem: Accidentally committed conflict markers

# Reset last commit (keep changes)
git reset --soft HEAD~1

# Fix the file and recommit
Branch Management Issues
Problem: Can't delete branch

# Force delete unmerged branch (use cautiously)
git branch -D branch-name

# Check if branch is merged first
git branch --merged
Problem: Lost track of current branch

# Show current branch clearly
git branch --show-current

# Show all branches with last commit
git branch -v
Common Git Workflow Mistakes
Problem: Committed to wrong branch

# Move last commit to new branch
git branch new-branch-name
git reset --hard HEAD~1
git checkout new-branch-name
Problem: Need to undo last commit

# Undo commit, keep changes staged
git reset --soft HEAD~1

# Undo commit, keep changes unstaged
git reset HEAD~1

# Undo commit, discard changes (careful!)
git reset --hard HEAD~1
